<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<!--
    RackForge mark, single ink: the themed monochrome launcher variant.

    The mark is 704x308, held to 540 wide so its 589-unit diagonal stays inside
    the 611-unit safe circle an adaptive icon guarantees (66dp of 108dp).

    A VectorDrawable has no masks, so the two node knockouts are built from the
    geometry instead: the strokes stop short of each node and the node itself is
    an even-odd ring. That is why the bowl starts at x=92, the crossbar at
    x=562, and the spines end at y=188 and y=212 rather than meeting at 200.

    Paint order is the drawing: the leg is stroked before the bowl of the R so
    the bar truncates it, and the nodes are filled last.
-->
